        101.04
      ],
      "text": "GOVERNMENT OF INDIA(SHARAD SARKAR)\nCABINET SECRETARIAT(NARYALHARDAL SACHIVALAYA)"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 2,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        101.04,
        446.25,
        101.04,
        446.25,
        151.56,
        166.6,
        151.56
      ],
      "text": "New Delhi, 14 January, 1980.\n24 Pausa, 1901(S)."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 3,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        151.56,
        446.25,
        151.56,
        446.25,
        185.24,
        166.6,
        185.24
      ],
      "text": "Subject:- Swearing-in ceremony -"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 4,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        185.24,
        446.25,
        185.24,
        446.25,
        269.44,
        166.6,
        269.44
      ],
      "text": "The undersigned is directed to say that the\nCouncil of Ministers as shown in Annexure 'A' have\ntheir respective offices with effect from\nthe forenoon of 14th January, 1980."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 5,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        269.44,
        446.25,
        269.44,
        446.25,
        353.64,
        166.6,
        353.64
      ],
      "text": "2. Smt. Indira Gandhi has been sworn-in as the\nPrime Minister by the President at 10-45 A.M. today,\n14th January, 1980, in the Rashtrapati Bhavan. Other\nMinisters sworn-in by the President at 10-45 A.M. today,\n14th January, 1980 are shown at Annexure 'B'."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 6,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        353.64,
        446.25,
        353.64,
        446.25,
        421.0,
        166.6,
        421.0
      ],
      "text": "3. Ministry of Home Affairs may kindly take\nsuch action as may be considered necessary regarding\nIssue of Gazette Notifications, etc."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 7,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        421.0,
        446.25,
        421.0,
        446.25,
        471.52,
        166.6,
        471.52
      ],
      "text": "(S. Iyengar)\nDeputy Secretary to the Cabinet."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 8,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        471.52,
        446.25,
        471.52,
        446.25,
        522.04,
        166.6,
        522.04
      ],
      "text": "To\n\nMinistry of Home Affairs\n(Shri B.G. Deshmukh - Additional Secretary)"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "order": 9,
      "poly": [
        166.6,
        522.04,
        446.25,
        522.04,
        446.25,
        589.4,
        166.6,
        589.4
      ],
      "text": "Copy forwarded for information to:-\n(i) Lok Sabha Secretariat\n (Shri A.S. Aithy - Secretary)\n(ii) Rajya Sabha Secretariat\n (Shri S.S. Shaloram - Secretary-General)"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
